  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_01",
      "hash64": "C4A6708980CF29D9",
      "text": "Hola a todos. ¿Listos para seguir aprendiendo\\nmates mientras nos divertimos?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_02",
      "hash64": "C4A66D8980CF24C0",
      "text": "Os voy a hacer una pregunta. ¿Os gusta la\\nastrología?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_03",
      "hash64": "C4A66E8980CF2673",
      "text": "Como sabréis, el noticiario matutino tiene una\\nsección dedicada a la astrología: el horóscopo.\\c\\nCada vez que anuncian un buen pronóstico para\\nel día, salgo de casa con una sonrisa en la cara.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_04",
      "hash64": "C4A6738980CF2EF2",
      "text": "La suerte también tiene un lado matemático.\\n¡De eso vamos a hablar hoy![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_05",
      "hash64": "C4A6748980CF30A5",
      "text": "A veces, en los combates Pokémon, uno de los\\ncombatientes asesta un golpe crítico.\\c\\n¿Os ha pasado alguna vez?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_06",
      "hash64": "C4A6718980CF2B8C",
      "text": "Un golpe crítico inflige el daño habitual\\nmultiplicado por 1,5. Es decir, un 150 %.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_07",
      "hash64": "C4A6728980CF2D3F",
      "text": "Es imposible predecir si tu Pokémon asestará un\\ngolpe crítico... ¡o si lo hará el rival!\\c\\nTodo depende de la fortuna. Y un golpe crítico\\npuede cambiar de pleno el rumbo del combate.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_08",
      "hash64": "C4A6778980CF35BE",
      "text": "¿Alguien conoce la probabilidad aproximada de\\nque un Pokémon aseste un golpe crítico?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "7C8CF0001D8940DF",
      "text": "Un 1 % (una de cada cien veces)",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "7C8CF1001D894292",
      "text": "Un 4 % (cuatro de cada cien veces)",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "7C8CF2001D894445",
      "text": "Un 12 % (doce de cada cien veces)",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "367A6F7BC753DC72",
      "text": "Ay, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nEs un pelín más probable de lo que tú dices,\\ncriatura.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "367A6E7BC753DABF",
      "text": "¡Muy bien! ¡Se nota que has estudiado este tema,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "367A6D7BC753D90C",
      "text": "Te has pasado un pelín, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\n¿No te parece que doce veces de cien es mucho?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_09",
      "hash64": "C4A6788980CF3771",
      "text": "La probabilidad exacta es del 4,17 % o, lo que\\nes lo mismo, una de cada veinticuatro veces.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_10",
      "hash64": "C4A9F58980D241AF",
      "text": "Aunque existen movimientos, como Roca Afilada\\ny Garra Umbría, que tienen un índice de golpe\\r\\ncrítico más elevado: ¡un 12 %![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_11",
      "hash64": "C4A9F48980D23FFC",
      "text": "Hay también formas de aumentar la probabilidad\\nde asestar golpes críticos; por ejemplo, el objeto\\r\\nCrítico X o el movimiento Foco Energía.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_12",
      "hash64": "C4A9F78980D24515",
      "text": "¡Su uso permite aumentar en dos niveles el índice\\nde golpe crítico, llegando a alcanzar un 50 % de\\r\\nprobabilidades de asestar uno![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_13",
      "hash64": "C4A9F68980D24362",
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon propina un golpe crítico, su\\nEntrenador se lleva una alegría... ¡pero, cuando\\r\\nlo hace el rival, es un horror![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_14",
      "hash64": "C4A9F18980D23AE3",
      "text": "Aunque no lo parezca, en los combates Pokémon\\ninfluye mucho la probabilidad matemática.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_15",
      "hash64": "C4A9F08980D23930",
      "text": "Si calculáis estas cosas y os sonríe la fortuna, tal\\nvez ampliéis vuestras estrategias de combate.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_16",
      "hash64": "C4A9F38980D23E49",
      "text": "Ah, ¿ha sonado el timbre? Qué pena. Bueno,\\nentonces aquí lo dejamos por hoy.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_17",
      "hash64": "C4A9F28980D23C96",
      "text": "¡Recordad que en la clase siguiente tendrá lugar\\nel examen parcial! Preparaos a conciencia.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
